OL,3,GNEWSA'Our plans will change the way
OL,4,Apeople see city'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA developer is hoping Wolverhampton
OL,7,Fcould be the forerunner for projects to
OL,8,F'de-pave' city centres and turn them
OL,9,Finto green spaces.
OL,11,FCapital & Centric has lodged a proposal
OL,12,Fto spend #100m transforming the St
OL,13,FGeorge's site - the former home of the
OL,14,FSainsbury's supermarket - into housing
OL,15,Fand green streets.
OL,17,FIf granted approval, Tim Heatley, the
OL,18,Fsocial impact developer's founder, has
OL,19,Fsaid they hope to start breaking ground
OL,20,Fearly next year.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
